{{ JSON.stringify($('Read The Headlines').all().map(i => i.json).filter(h => h.headlines.length), null, 1) }}

Write two to four sentences on what these moves have in common and what a holder should look at first. If the headlines do not explain a move, say the move is unexplained rather than inventing a reason for it. If there is only one name, write about that one. No preamble, no bullet points, no sign-off.

